WEBVTT

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.980
The popular dating reality show,

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.490
<i>The Bachelor</i>, has finally arrived in Granvania.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.220
The one selected to be the bachelor is...

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:17.740
Yuge Itsuki.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:23.370
Our chosen Visitor from Sola, Yuge Itsuki.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.880
The twelve female participants 
are all very different.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.880
Who will be the one to win his heart?

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.120
The twelve maidens have gathered 
from all around the world.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:35.390
A wide range of ages and backgrounds.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:40.350
The only thing they have in common is 
that they're after the bachelor's heart.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:44.140
These twelve beauties will try 
to win over bachelor Itsuki!

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.320
The twelve maidens looking 
for the Ultimate Love Ritual

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.900
will engage in intense romantic battles!

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.400
There will be plots, jealousy, alliances,

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.000
betrayals, and frustration 
between the maidens.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.410
The one who will decide the 
winner is... the bachelor!

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:03.950
What is the Ultimate Love Ritual
 that awaits the winner?

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:37.260
I am the Visitor's servant, Mana.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.810
As you all know, the duty of maidens 
is to give birth to Star Children.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:44.780
However, it seems that some of you 
have yet to fulfill your duty.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.800
Mirei, Sue. I'm talking about you two.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:51.900
Therefore, I have prepared the
 Ultimate Love Ritual this time.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.400
Ultimate...

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:54.900
Love Ritual?

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.310
What is that?

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.900
Tsk, tsk, I can't tell you yet.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.840
You'll find out when you experience it.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:05.530
It is a truly sacred paradise that 
will send you to the heavens!

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:11.420
However, only one maiden who captures 
Visitor Itsuki's heart will get to enjoy it.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:15.170
A passionate date battle will now 
begin to determine the winner!

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:19.170
A letter from Visitor Itsuki 
has arrived. Read it out loud.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:23.600
"Let's have the best date 
and strengthen our bond."

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.980
"The one who will date me today is..."

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:26.930
"Sue!"

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.990
She's gone!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.880
Shh, they'll find you.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:40.530
Sheesh, I thought I told you that 
you can't bring animals here.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.580
I'm sorry. He's Quelquelle.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.460
He gets lonely very easily—

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:49.230
You sensed that I was releasing a lot of 
pheromones earlier, so you're all turned on?

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:50.460
You pervert rooster!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:53.800
Your comb is red and swollen!

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.540
He's just excited because 
a stranger came over.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.080
It's all right, Quelquelle.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.420
Good boy.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.020
Come on. We have to hurry.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.430
Itsuki is looking forward to your date.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:07.720
Okay.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.060
Hello.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.540
I wanted to learn more about you today, Sue.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.780
I thought we could have a date 
together with the animals.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.480
You take care of all 
these animals, right, Sue?

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.370
Yes.

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:40.090
I brought them to the academy from home.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.610
They're all my precious friends.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:44.760
They're cute.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.480
Yes, they are.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:54.330
They're pretty noisy, so not many people 
have anything nice to say about them.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.350
I'm glad you did. Thank you.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:01.130
I've prepared a feast for the animals, too.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.540
My fruit basket!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:13.430
Eat up! Eat!

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:17.950
No, not there!

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:23.060
They used to study animals outside the town.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.730
My parents studied animals.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.250
Dad was a researcher 
and Mom was a veterinarian.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.390
They always embraced me gently.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.820
But they...

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:40.150
You don't have to force yourself to tell me.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.400
It's all right.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.750
I want you to know.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:51.660
On that day, Dad and Mom were attacked by 
Impurities that came close to the town.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:56.520
They protected me and hugged me 
until the Impurities went away.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:00.660
That was the last time they embraced me.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.270
But the truth is...

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:07.070
My heart is still in pain.

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:09.470
I can't accept that my parents are gone.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.250
I can't accept what happened on that day!

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:16.830
But I had these animals with me,

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.220
so I was able to live on even though I was sad.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.210
I never knew...

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:31.020
We were able to talk about a lot of things,

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.700
and I feel our bond was strengthened.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.920
I can't forgive the Impurities 
that attacked Sue's parents.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:40.120
My sense of duty as the Visitor...

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.710
I feel a strong emotion growing inside me.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.660
I'm bored.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:01.140
I wonder what kind of 
date they're having now.

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:03.580
Anyway, Mahiru...

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:06.360
How was your first Love Ritual?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.880
W-Well...

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.580
It was a piece of cake for me.

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:12.490
Really?

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.490
What about you, Mahiru?

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:18.700
I... don't really remember.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.120
It was too embarrassing.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.130
Geez! Stop trying to ask me!

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:29.840
Yes, I understand that Itsuki is working hard

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.600
to get us back to our world.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:35.800
The Love Ritual is an important 
ritual to make that happen.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.750
The other maidens are all good girls,

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.810
so I wish the best for them.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:46.000
Thanks for the fun date today.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.900
No, I should be thanking you.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.320
Welcome!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.820
Let me show you how I feel!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.570
Sushi rice at the bottom,

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.330
plenty of love,

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.310
and shiny fish on top!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.740
Complete!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.050
Bateira!

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:08.350
It means "small boat" in Portuguese!

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:11.440
My heart sways with love for you.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:12.840
Please accept my feelings.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.610
Thank you.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.490
This is a surprise.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.920
Who would've thought the fated bateira sushi 
would be offered to Sue so soon.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:39.370
What a turn of events.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.860
Yes.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:44.090
By the way, what's fated bateira sushi?

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:44.810
What?

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:47.290
Huh? You didn't know?

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.380
Well, I did expect that, 
so please take a look at this.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:09:01.390
<b>{リタイア}Out</b>

00:08:50.380 --> 00:09:01.390
<b>Winner!</b>

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:54.920
The Visitor can make bateira 
sushi for someone he likes.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:59.450
Only maidens who receive it 
can remain in the competition.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:01.390
Oh, now I get it!

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:04.160
Okay then, let's speak with 
Mana-san at the scene.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:05.390
Mana-san?

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.840
Hello!

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:09.310
What do you think about the 
bateira sushi right off the bat?

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:12.240
Not enough stimulation, at all!

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:13.370
What do you mean by stimulation?

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.390
The real battle has only begun!

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:18.120
I'll set up a dirty date 
filled with perversion

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:22.410
for all of you to enjoy in front of your TV!

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.410
<b><i>Granvania TV Station</i></b>

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:28.510
A new invitation letter has 
arrived from the Visitor.

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:31.370
This time there will be a group date.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:32.570
The participants are:

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:33.550
Lily.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:34.920
Arie.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.140
Falun.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:37.180
Femiruna.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.550
Reone.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.660
Mirei.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:44.720
The Visitor is a mysterious existence 
from an alternate world called Sola.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:47.440
There isn't any subject that is 
more interesting for research.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:51.340
I will find out everything 
about the Visitor, Itsuki.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.320
Research is the sole reason I came here.

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.720
Welcome, everyone!

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:00.030
Itsuki is in the room at 
the end of these stairs!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:04.910
Only the one who reaches the top first 
can advance to the private date!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.880
And this is a present from me!

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.380
Enjoy!

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.280
Lotions!

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:16.220
Moisten your skin with sticky ingredients!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.630
Soft and smooth skin for you all!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.750
Now climb!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:32.400
What's wrong? Climb up!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.280
I can't hold it any longer...

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.890
N-No way!

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.780
Hold on to it!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:53.040
Lord, give me strength!

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.280
The one who calmly climbed up is...

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:04.020
Mirei!

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:08.360
Mirei, you came over?

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:09.060
Thank you.

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:11.440
You don't have to thank me.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:15.940
If you like, you should take a bath 
and clean your body.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.600
Yes, I will.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:22.140
I can't see well without my glasses.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:25.950
Looks like my vision got worse again.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.950
Then give me your hand.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:29.790
Are you all right?

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.050
Take your time.

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:32.260
You're very helpful.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.210
What is it?

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:37.790
I just thought it's interesting to occasionally

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:41.210
leave myself in someone else's hands.

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:44.570
What a nice rose scent.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.870
M-Mirei, aren't we a bit too close?

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.730
Oh, sorry.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.520
But since my sight is poor,

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.480
I'm more sensitive to your touch.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.840
Your body temperature 
and the texture of your skin...

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.560
The warmth of your body...

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.500
Yes, this is quite intriguing.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.240
It's a feeling I have never 
experienced before.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:07.690
Mirei, where are you touching?

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:10.750
It's all right. Hold it for a while.

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.640
What's this?

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.880
I can't see very well, but it's very hard.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.620
Th-That's...

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.500
What's wrong?

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.640
Stop!

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:23.630
You're taking advantage... 
of the situation...

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.890
Oh, this is the reaction?

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:29.260
I see. I'll need to collect more data.

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:32.730
It's all for research.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:36.650
Since my vision is blurry...

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.860
it makes me want to touch you more...

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.040
and depend on you more...

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.650
That's how I feel.

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:48.250
I've only seen the cool and calm side of her,

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:51.420
so my heart skipped a beat when 
I saw her being so different.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:55.940
Where she touched me under the bubbles?

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:59.920
Please leave that to your imagination.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:07.060
Mirei.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.040
Please have this, too!

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.260
Thank you.

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:15.310
You've decided to keep me...

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.730
You've got guts.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:29.550
I'll have you stay with 
me longer for my research.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:33.500
Well, I won't do anything 
scary for the research.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.020
Don't worry.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:41.670
And so, Itsuki and the maidens had 
one gorgeous date after another,

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:44.420
and the ones who remained to the end were...

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.150
Mirei and Sue.

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:49.260
It's down to these two maidens.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.020
Who will he choose?

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:55.370
Let's take some time and see how 
Itsuki will make his approach!

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.890
Meow!

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:15.000
Meow.

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:20.060
This animal gets pretty lonely,

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.520
so you have to play with her.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:25.510
Will you take good care of her?

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.010
Yes, of course.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:30.990
I love animals, so I've always wanted a tail.

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.760
I mustered up my courage to put it on today.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.660
It looks good on you.

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:41.500
I get a steamy feeling in 
my heart when I'm with you.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.770
Steamy?

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.780
Warm and comfortable.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:49.980
The same feeling as when I was 
embraced by Mom and Dad.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:53.030
But I'm starting to get scared.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.030
Scared of what?

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.840
I've lived alone for all this time.

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:01.450
If I let you spoil me, I'll get weak...

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:04.170
I might not survive without you.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.550
There's nothing wrong with being weak.

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:08.550
But...

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:13.900
Sue, you've been all alone 
since your parents left.

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:16.220
There's nothing wrong with 
getting spoiled a bit.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:20.900
What if you leave me, like Mom and Dad?

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:23.420
I'm scared.

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:25.790
I'm scared that you might leave.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:26.730
Sue...

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:28.880
I don't want you to go to the labyrinth,

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.990
I don't want you to be in danger.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.500
I don't want to lose you!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.010
I'm scared...

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:36.680
Don't worry.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:41.520
Living in this world made me want to 
save this world where everybody lives.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.750
I really feel this way.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:47.290
To make that happen, I want to give birth to

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:51.200
a stronger Star Child than ever 
with the Ultimate Love Ritual.

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.260
Okay.

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:58.180
I promise to defeat the 
Impurities and come back to you.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:02.390
We've heard your entire conversation!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:03.100
Huh?

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.950
Finding out Sue's story made me think...

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:08.400
and I've reached a conclusion!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.820
A conclusion?

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:13.410
Sue and Mirei were competing 
to be selected by you,

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:17.410
but the Ultimate Love Ritual doesn't 
really have to be one on one!

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:19.130
By that, you mean...

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:22.290
Yes, a Double Love Ritual!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:26.300
I also want to respect Sue's 
feelings as a fellow maiden.

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:30.430
I agree to having the 
Ultimate Love Ritual together.

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:33.550
I'll be able to gather even 
more interesting data!

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:36.110
T-Two at the same time?

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:40.470
I c-can't do something so embarrassing...

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.230
Mana, I'm sorry,

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:46.480
but I can't force Sue to do 
it if she doesn't want to.

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.480
I was expecting you to say that.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:54.520
Don't worry. I'm a researcher.

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:57.840
I am prepared for an event like this.

00:16:57.840 --> 00:16:59.990
I wanted to test it for a while...

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:03.500
This experimental medicine that 
will improve Love Rituals!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.250
W-Wait! What is that?

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:08.890
Mirei... Mirei!

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:10.010
Stay away! No—

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:13.010
It's the hypnosis gas I developed!

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.480
Now Sue won't feel embarrassed,

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:18.390
and will be honest about her feelings!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.570
Are you all right, Sue?

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.300
Sue?

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:26.760
Meow!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:33.040
As an added bonus, I also added 
a sensitivity-increasing gas!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:35.880
To perform the Ultimate Love Ritual,

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.300
added sensitivity will 
increase your feelings, too!

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:41.820
Here, here, here...

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:45.540
Here, here, here...

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:50.730
This kitty has a very cute cry.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:56.260
It should start working on you, 
since you're breathing it, too!

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.260
Oh no, I can't hold it any longer!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.070
I can't stand it!

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:07.580
Nothing beats seeing a serious girl
 lose control to her desires!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:10.670
Come on! The maidens are fully prepared!

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:14.030
All that's left is to do what 
you're meant to do as the Visitor!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.030
Yeah!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:17.780
Please! Have my child!

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:20.280
Okay!

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.830
Wait, relax, you guys!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.160
Calm down!

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.480
Stop, no food now!

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:34.120
Oh no, my body is sensitive from that gas!

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:38.010
Stop! Don't look at me like beasts!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:41.390
Not there... What's this? Don't stop!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:44.010
No! I'm gonna get wild!

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:48.050
More, more, more, come on!

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:51.360
And so, the bond between 
the three strengthened,

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:55.070
and two strong Star Children were born!

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:58.730
Itsuki-san, I watched <i>The Bachelor!</i>

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:02.010
I was so surprised at the conclusion!

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.930
I'm kinda embarrassed.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:08.080
But I'm glad strong Star Children
 were born in the end.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.280
Yeah.

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:12.080
The offering of the Star Wards 
is going smoothly, too.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.820
At this rate, it won't be long before we can

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:18.190
seal all 12 Labyrinths of Constellations.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.970
That's amazing.

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.800
I expected nothing less of you.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.600
But after you fulfill 
your duty as the Visitor,

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.800
you'll be going back to Sola, right?

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:31.100
Soon I won't be able to see you anymore?

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:35.200
N-No, that was nothing.

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.610
Please don't mind me.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.520
That roar again!

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:43.620
Itsuki, you have to come 
to the castle right away!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:48.730
It seems you have all gathered here.

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.120
Please, begin.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.230
Actually, I was researching 
the ancient documents,

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:55.980
and I found out that 
Granvania has a labyrinth

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:59.260
other than the 12 Labyrinths 
of Constellations.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:00.130
What did you say?!

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:05.520
This ancient document describes the 
existence of a 13th labyrinth.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:06.760
And in there,

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:11.080
according to the writings, 
the 13th phantom is sealed.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:15.550
By 13th phantom, does it mean something 
different to the Impurity Lords?

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:18.270
It seems like the 13th phantom

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:21.240
is the source of Impurities in this world.

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:26.090
In other words, the Impurities will be 
revived again unless we seal it.

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:26.990
How can that be?

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:31.260
However, we still haven't found the 
entrance to the 13th labyrinth,

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.250
or figured out how we can prevent the revival.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.930
I want you to offer

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:39.020
all the remaining Star Wards 
of the 12 constellations

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:40.630
while we find the answers.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:41.880
I understand.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:45.200
Sealing the 13th phantom.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:48.040
That will be the next duty of the Visitor.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:51.390
It will be an even tougher 
battle than before, Itsuki.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.340
Yes...

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:55.050
Hmm...

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:56.570
What is it, Mana?

00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:59.920
There were 12 labyrinths and 12 maidens.

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:04.700
And now, the existence of the 13th 
labyrinth has come to light, which means...

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.570
Congratulations, Itsuki!

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:10.280
This must be a sign that 
there's also a 13th maiden!

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:12.840
As soon as you finish the Love 
Ritual with the 12 maidens,

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:17.560
you'll have a new girl 
you can have fun conquering!

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:18.990
Nose bleed!

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:20.490
Yeah, yeah.

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:23.240
But I wonder where she is.

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:25.260
Could it be me, by any chance?

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.970
I can learn to like beasts.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:29.870
Sheesh, you sure are a real pervert.

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:31.970
I have someone else in mind, too!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:36.230
Who says a maiden has to be a girl?

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:40.230
Maybe.

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:45.240
Wow! Maybe the next episode 
will be Boys' Love Ritual?!

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:48.510
No! But I don't hate it!

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:51.720
Female viewership will improve for sure!

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:52.490
Huh?

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:59.750
Goodbye isn't a word of farewell...

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:30.010
<b>My Child, Welcome!</b>

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:40.020
Let's Try Giving Birth, Together

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:39.690
Pizza Margherita.
